WebKitGTK (in the AppImage only)
Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later, and BSD
licences for parts. https://webkitgtk.org

The AppImage bundles Ubuntu 24.04's libwebkitgtk-6.0-4 binary package, and the
build modifies it: packaging/appimage/build-appimage.sh overwrites every
occurrence of the C string /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/webkitgtk-6.0 in
libwebkitgtk-6.0.so.4 with an equally long /tmp/.stacked-webkit-<hash>, so the
library looks for its helper processes where Stacked stages them (ADR-045,
crates/cordial-shell/src/webkit_helpers.rs). Nothing else in it is changed. The
source is Ubuntu's webkitgtk source package of the bundled version; the
AppImage states the version and the change in
usr/share/licenses/stacked/webkitgtk-MODIFIED.txt. The other packages
(.deb, .rpm, Arch, Flatpak) use the distribution's WebKitGTK unmodified.
